The sprint board is built in `src/` (`App.tsx`, `BoardPage.tsx`, `ArchivePage.tsx`, `model.ts`, `styles.ts`), and `./check` and `./test` both pass, with all 26 visible tests green. I did not add hidden-test coverage beyond the brief, and I'm not sure about two things: the visible run logged one 404 in the first test (probably a favicon request, not checked), and I assumed the harness treats each button as "near" its card or item row through a shared parent. Both `./check` and `./test` ran twice of the 15 allowed.